<title>USA: Hudson Hotels purchases five hotels.</title>
<headline>Hudson Hotels purchases five hotels.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Hotels Corp said it had completed the acquisition of five hotels in exchange for 1,170,103 shares of Hudson common.</p>
<p>The company previously held minority interests in and managed all five properties, the company said in a statement issued on Thursday.</p>
<p>The five hotels include a resort suite hotel in Florida and a full-service hotel, two Comfort Inns and one EconoLodge in upstate New York, Hudson said.</p>
<p>A sixth property was deleted from the transaction, the company said. Hudson said it will continue to manage this property and may acquire it at a later date.</p>
</text>
